Do you know of the recently popular play called 
Forever Love?

The tale of the play is about a tragic story of 
a princess who fell in love with enemy's King, 
but the truth is that the play is based on a 
true story.

Long time ago, when Valento who was Temskoron's 
King and also a great warrior visited Morion, he 
met Cara who was the princess of Morion, and he 
promised to love her forever.

Unfortunately, due to the political reasons, they 
could not be together in the end, but their love 
story is still being told among people in 
generations.

However, it is truely terrible that their love is 
being used by the evil Igolanose. If it is possible 
to undo the curse on their souls, is it going to 
at least weaken evil Igolanose a bit?

First, we need to blind Igonaose so go to Gallubia 
Valley and defeat 20 Cold Eyes please.